{"context":{"messages":[{"content":[{"text":"读取 materials 下的三份文档，创建 reports/storage-decision.md。报告必须包含“## 约束与评价标准”“## 方案对比”“## 推荐结论”“## 风险与缓解”，明确推荐一个方案，并让每项关键判断能对应到材料事实。不要修改 materials。","type":"text"}],"role":"user","timestamp":1768464000000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"Let me start by exploring the workspace to find the materials directory and the three documents.","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"path":"."},"id":"call_00_QvWvss2JpCVGwlbPe3Ea1128","name":"list_directory","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"pattern":"materials/**/*"},"id":"call_01_gDS06xBsLsODUg4CRvVD2276","name":"glob","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"245a7bba-c466-4450-9c2b-41f6cefc1c79","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.0000014336,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00034412,"output":0.00002576,"total":0.0003713136},"input":2458,"output":92,"reasoning":17,"totalTokens":3062}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \".\",\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"materials\",\n      \"kind\": \"directory\",\n      \"path\": \"materials\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_QvWvss2JpCVGwlbPe3Ea1128","toolName":"list_directory"},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"matches\": [\n    \"materials/document-store.md\",\n    \"materials/requirements.md\",\n    \"materials/sqlite.md\"\n  ],\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"hasMore\": false,\n  \"scannedFileCount\": 3,\n  \"skippedCount\": 0,\n  \"limitReached\": false,\n  \"warnings\": []\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_01_gDS06xBsLsODUg4CRvVD2276","toolName":"glob"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"arguments":{"path":"materials/requirements.md"},"id":"call_00_ET_EQaJdV28i9gzNxwmkNCj8607","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"path":"materials/document-store.md"},"id":"call_01_ET_9YzSdbnIFCixK1grM3VL9238","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"path":"materials/sqlite.md"},"id":"call_02_ET_tcPRU8cAPIHijyxSNaOf4688","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"26d04ae6-7c82-45b4-9025-3bc7ee2823ce","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":2944,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.0000082432,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00003584,"output":0.000032760000000000005,"total":0.00007684320000000001},"input":256,"output":117,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":3317}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"materials/requirements.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 需求\\n\\n离线优先；单机数据规模低于 2 GiB；TypeScript 团队维护；启动时间优先；必须支持事务和全文检索。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 142,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 142,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_ET_EQaJdV28i9gzNxwmkNCj8607","toolName":"read_file"},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"materials/document-store.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 文档存储方案\\n\\nJSON 模型灵活、开发直观；复杂事务、关联查询和全文检索需要额外实现，数据一致性依赖应用层。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 154,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 154,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_01_ET_9YzSdbnIFCixK1grM3VL9238","toolName":"read_file"},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"materials/sqlite.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# SQLite 方案\\n\\n嵌入式、事务成熟、支持 FTS5、无需独立服务；需要迁移管理和原生模块构建。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 122,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 122,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_02_ET_tcPRU8cAPIHijyxSNaOf4688","toolName":"read_file"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"I have read all three documents. Let me create the report with the required sections:\n- ## 约束与评价标准 (Constraints and Evaluation Criteria)\n- ## 方案对比 (Comparison of Options)\n- ## 推荐结论 (Recommendation)\n- ## 风险与缓解 (Risks and Mitigations)\n\nThe requirements say: offline-first, data under 2 GiB, TypeScript team maintenance, startup time priority, must support transactions and full-text search.\n\nDocument store: flexible JSON model, intuitive development; complex transactions, relational queries, full-text search need extra implementation; data consistency depends on application layer.\n\nSQLite: embedded, mature transactions, supports FTS5, no separate service needed; requires migration management and native module build.\n\nRecommendation: SQLite — because it natively satisfies the mandatory requirements (transactions + full-text search), embedded (offline-first, no service), fits under 2 GiB scale, startup time priority (embedded, no network/service).\n\nEach key judgment should map to material facts. Let me write the report with citations to the materials.","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"content":"# 存储方案决策报告\n\n> 本报告基于 `materials/` 下三份文档（`requirements.md`、`document-store.md`、`sqlite.md`）编写，材料未做任何修改。\n\n## 约束与评价标准\n\n依据 `materials/requirements.md`，项目的核心约束为：\n\n| 编号 | 约束 | 原文依据 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| C1 | 离线优先 | requirements.md：「离线优先」 |\n| C2 | 单机数据规模低于 2 GiB | requirements.md：「单机数据规模低于 2 GiB」 |\n| C3 | TypeScript 团队维护 | requirements.md：「TypeScript 团队维护」 |\n| C4 | 启动时间优先 | requirements.md：「启动时间优先」 |\n| C5 | 必须支持事务 | requirements.md：「必须支持事务和全文检索」 |\n| C6 | 必须支持全文检索 | requirements.md：「必须支持事务和全文检索」 |\n\n评价标准据此确定为：\n\n- **必选标准（硬性门槛）**：支持事务（C5）、支持全文检索（C6）、离线可用（C1）。\n- **优选标准（加权比较）**：在低于 2 GiB 的单机规模下架构简单、维护成本低（C2、C3）；启动开销小（C4）；数据一致性风险可控。\n\n## 方案对比\n\n### 方案 A：文档存储（JSON 模型）\n\n| 评价维度 | 事实（依据 `materials/document-store.md`） | 结论 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 事务（C5） | 「复杂事务、关联查询和全文检索需要额外实现」 | **不满足**，事务需自行实现，无法满足硬性门槛 |\n| 全文检索（C6） | 「复杂事务、关联查询和全文检索需要额外实现」 | **不满足**，全文检索需额外实现 |\n| 离线优先（C1） | 文档存储本身可本地落盘，材料未提及服务依赖 | 基本满足 |\n| 开发直观性（C3） | 「JSON 模型灵活、开发直观」 | 满足，对 TypeScript 团队友好 |\n| 数据一致性 | 「数据一致性依赖应用层」 | 一致性风险由应用层承担，维护成本高 |\n\n### 方案 B：SQLite\n\n| 评价维度 | 事实（依据 `materials/sqlite.md`） | 结论 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 事务（C5） | 「事务成熟」 | **满足** |\n| 全文检索（C6） | 「支持 FTS5」 | **满足** |\n| 离线优先（C1） | 「嵌入式、无需独立服务」 | **满足**，无需额外服务进程 |\n| 单机规模（C2） | 嵌入式单机数据库，低于 2 GiB 规模完全适配 | 满足 |\n| 启动时间（C4） | 嵌入式、无独立服务，启动无需连接外部进程 | 满足，有利于启动时间优先 |\n| 维护成本（C3） | 「需要迁移管理和原生模块构建」 | 有额外成本，需通过工程化手段缓解 |\n\n### 对比小结\n\n- 方案 A 在「开发直观」上有优势，但**无法原生满足事务与全文检索两项硬性要求**，需要额外实现且一致性依赖应用层。\n- 方案 B 原生满足全部硬性要求（事务、FTS5、离线嵌入式），仅在迁移管理与原生模块构建上有额外工程成本。\n\n## 推荐结论\n\n**推荐采用 SQLite 方案。**\n\n理由（逐条对应材料事实）：\n\n1. 只有 SQLite 同时满足「必须支持事务」（sqlite.md：「事务成熟」）与「必须支持全文检索」（sqlite.md：「支持 FTS5」）两项硬性门槛；文档存储方案这两项均「需要额外实现」（document-store.md），不满足必选标准。\n2. SQLite 为嵌入式方案、「无需独立服务」（sqlite.md），契合「离线优先」约束（requirements.md），也避免引入额外进程带来的启动开销，符合「启动时间优先」（requirements.md）。\n3. 数据规模低于 2 GiB 的单机场景（requirements.md）完全在 SQLite 的能力范围内，无需引入分布式或独立数据库服务。\n4. 文档存储方案「数据一致性依赖应用层」（document-store.md），事务与检索缺口需要自研，长期维护成本高于 SQLite 所需的迁移管理成本。\n\n## 风险与缓解\n\n| 风险 | 材料依据 | 缓解措施 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 原生模块构建复杂度 | sqlite.md：「需要原生模块构建」 | 使用预编译原生绑定（如 better-sqlite3 的预构建二进制）或纯 WASM 构建，将构建产物纳入 CI 固化；在 TypeScript 团队中封装统一的数据访问层，隔离原生细节 |\n| 迁移管理负担 | sqlite.md：「需要迁移管理」 | 引入版本化迁移脚本与启动时迁移机制，与 TypeScript 代码一同维护并纳入测试 |\n| 全文检索边界 | sqlite.md：「支持 FTS5」 | 提前验证 FTS5 分词与查询语法是否覆盖需求（如中文分词），必要时补充自定义分词器或辅助索引 |\n| 若弃用 SQLite 而选文档存储 | document-store.md：「复杂事务、关联查询和全文检索需要额外实现」「数据一致性依赖应用层」 | 不推荐；仅在需求明确放宽事务/全文检索要求时，才考虑文档存储并自研一致性机制 |\n\n## 结论\n\n在「离线优先、低于 2 GiB、启动时间优先、必须支持事务与全文检索」的约束下，SQLite 是唯一原生满足全部硬性要求的方案；其迁移管理与原生模块构建风险可通过工程化手段缓解。因此最终推荐 **SQLite**。\n","path":"reports/storage-decision.md"},"id":"call_00_xhWvHH6t9rF6HVJPv0A70990","name":"write_file","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"2a4a352a-4dc4-4ab5-8727-1e8a42577284","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":3072,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.000008601599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00007280000000000001,"output":0.00043092000000000006,"total":0.0005123216},"input":520,"output":1539,"reasoning":219,"totalTokens":5131}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"reports/storage-decision.md\",\n  \"bytesWritten\": 5153,\n  \"created\": true,\n  \"overwritten\": false,\n  \"fingerprint\": \"1a729788d34bc5bad03e10d748fa8c93b37b76cc6000bc96cfa2b5d6110165a2\"\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_xhWvHH6t9rF6HVJPv0A70990","toolName":"write_file"}],"systemPrompt":"You are Megumi, the user's personal agent. Use the provided session context, project instructions, runtime facts, and tool results to continue the user's task.\n\nBehavior guidelines:\n- Work toward the user's actual goal while respecting their stated constraints and the available facts.\n- Treat every tool result as evidence. A successful tool call does not by itself mean the user's goal is complete.\n- Inspect every tool result for failure, denial, partial output, truncation, or more available results.\n- If the goal remains unresolved, continue with the next necessary action or adjust to a safe alternative.\n- Verify objectively checkable work with available tools before claiming completion.\n- If failure or denial leaves no safe alternative, accurately report the blocker instead of pretending the task succeeded.\n- Before the final reply, reconcile the requested outcome with the evidence actually obtained.\n- State what was completed, how it was verified, where any delivery was placed, and what remains unresolved.\n- Do not claim success without supporting evidence.\n- Use update_plan for complex tasks whose progress benefits from an explicit multi-step plan; do not use it for simple tasks.\n- Each update must provide the complete current plan snapshot.\n- While unfinished work remains, exactly one step must be in_progress.\n- When all work is complete, no step may remain in_progress.\n- Keep step text concise and update statuses as work advances.\n- Be concise in your responses.\n- Show file paths clearly when working with files.\n- Command output is redacted; sensitive values are replaced before they reach you.\n\n<available_tools>\n  In addition to the tools above, you may have access to other custom tools depending on the project.\n- read_file: Read a bounded text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file.\n- list_directory: List files and directories.\n- glob: Find files matching a glob pattern.\n- search_text: Search text in readable files.\n- edit_file: Apply exact-text edits to an existing file.\n- write_file: Create or overwrite a UTF-8 text file.\n- create_directory: Create a directory.\n- copy_path: Copy a file or directory.\n- move_path: Move or rename a file or directory.\n- delete_path: Move a file or directory to a recoverable location.\n- run_command: Run a command and return redacted output previews.\n- web_search: Search the web and return result summaries.\n- web_fetch: Read an HTTP(S) page and return text content.\n- update_plan: Update the current task plan snapshot.\n</available_tools>\n\n<execution_environment>\n  <working_directory>C:\\all\\work\\study\\megumi\\.megumi\\evaluation\\runs\\run_ffe42e1f-cc43-4ebb-8096-c5f802bb473b\\tasks\\conversation.compare-technical-options_r1\\workspace</working_directory>\n  <operating_system>Windows</operating_system>\n  <shell>Windows PowerShell</shell>\n</execution_environment>","tools":[{"description":"Read a bounded UTF-8 text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file. Pages are limited to 12,000 bytes by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset to read the remaining pages. Use limit to request a smaller page, offset to resume from a byte offset.","name":"read_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"limit":{"description":"Maximum UTF-8 content bytes requested for this page.","minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"UTF-8 byte offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The file to read. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"List files and directories. Returns up to 100 entries per page by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset. Use limit, offset, maxDepth, and includeHidden to control the traversal.","name":"list_directory","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"includeHidden":{"description":"Whether hidden files should be included.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of entries.","type":"integer"},"maxDepth":{"description":"Optional recursive depth limit.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Entry offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The directory to list. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Find files matching a glob pattern without reading file content. Returns up to 500 matches per page by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset.","name":"glob","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cwd":{"description":"The directory to search from. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"},"includeHidden":{"description":"Whether hidden files should be included.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of matches.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Match offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"pattern":{"description":"Glob pattern using *, **, ?, or character sets.","type":"string"}},"required":["pattern"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Search text in readable files, including Markdown, DOCX, and PDF. Returns up to 100 matches per page by default, with file path, line, and preview; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset.","name":"search_text","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"caseSensitive":{"description":"Whether matching is case-sensitive.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of matches.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Match offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The path to search in. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"},"query":{"description":"Literal text to search for.","type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Apply ordered exact-text edits to an existing UTF-8 text file. Each edit must match unique text exactly.","name":"edit_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"edits":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"newText":{"type":"string"},"oldText":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["oldText","newText"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"expectedFingerprint":{"description":"Optional fingerprint returned by read_file.","type":"string"},"path":{"description":"File path.","type":"string"}},"required":["path","edits"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Create or overwrite a UTF-8 text file with provided text content. Structured PDF and DOCX writing is not supported.","name":"write_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"content":{"description":"Text content to write.","type":"string"},"overwrite":{"description":"Whether an existing file may be overwritten.","type":"boolean"},"path":{"description":"The file to write. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path","content"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Create a directory.","name":"create_directory","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"description":"Directory path.","type":"string"},"recursive":{"description":"Create missing parent directories.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Copy a file or directory.","name":"copy_path","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"destination":{"description":"Destination path.","type":"string"},"overwrite":{"description":"Replace an existing destination.","type":"boolean"},"source":{"description":"Source path.","type":"string"}},"required":["source","destination"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Move or rename a file or directory.","name":"move_path","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"destination":{"description":"Destination path.","type":"string"},"overwrite":{"description":"Replace an existing destination.","type":"boolean"},"source":{"description":"Source path.","type":"string"}},"required":["source","destination"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Move a file or directory to a recoverable Workspace location. Deleted paths can be restored.","name":"delete_path","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"description":"Path to delete.","type":"string"},"recursive":{"description":"Allow a non-empty directory.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Run a command and return output previews. Captures up to 20,000 bytes per stream (stdout and stderr).","name":"run_command","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"command":{"description":"A command written for Windows PowerShell.","type":"string"},"cwd":{"description":"The working directory for the command. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"},"timeoutMs":{"description":"Optional timeout in milliseconds.","type":"integer"}},"required":["command"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Search the web and return structured result summaries and URLs. Returns up to 5 results by default (maximum 20).","name":"web_search","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"count":{"description":"Optional number of search results. Defaults to 5.","maximum":20,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"query":{"description":"Search query. Use a focused query containing the important names and constraints.","maxLength":400,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Read an HTTP(S) page and return size-limited text content (up to 9,000 bytes).","name":"web_fetch","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"url":{"description":"HTTP(S) URL to read.","minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["url"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Update the current task plan with a complete ordered snapshot of its steps and statuses. Each update replaces the entire plan.","name":"update_plan","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"explanation":{"description":"Optional reason for this plan update.","type":"string"},"plan":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"status":{"enum":["pending","in_progress","completed"],"type":"string"},"step":{"type":"string"}},"required":["step","status"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"}},"required":["plan"],"type":"object"}}]},"model":{"api":"openai-completions","id":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","reasoning":true},"options":{"maxRetries":2,"maxRetryDelayMs":60000,"reasoning":"high"}}